578	### End-to-end behavior
579	
580	`POST /orders {"orderId":"o1","description":"Widget","quantity":2}`:
581	1. `OrderInvoker.createOrder` → `CommandGateway.send(CreateOrderCommand)` →
582	   `OrderAggregate.handle(...)` returns `OrderCreatedEvent`.
583	2. `OrderProjector` writes the `OrderView` (status `CREATED`); `OrderObserver` logs it;
584	   `OrderSaga` (init) sends `ConfirmOrderCommand`.
585	3. `OrderService.handle(ConfirmOrderCommand)` returns `OrderConfirmedEvent` →
586	   `OrderProjector` sets status `CONFIRMED`; `OrderSaga` second handler ends the saga.
587	4. `GET /orders/o1` → `FindOrderByIdQuery` → `OrderProjection` returns the view
588	   (eventually `CONFIRMED`). Issued too early, it may 500 until projectors catch up.
